libstr — attribution and license
=================================

The implementations in this directory (strlen, strcmp, strncmp,
strcpy, strncpy, strchr, memchr, memcpy, memset, memmove — in
libstr.c and the corresponding MIPS assembly in libstr.asm) are
adapted from musl libc's src/string/ subtree.

Source       https://musl.libc.org/
Repository   https://git.musl-libc.org/cgit/musl/tree/src/string

